---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Handmade solid wood kitchens, cabinetry, staircases, windows and doors, designed, made and fitted by cabinet maker Joel Dyter from his workshop in Hebden Bridge, West Yorkshire."
bodyClass: page-home
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cabinet maker · Hebden Bridge</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Handmade kitchens &amp; joinery, <em>made for your home.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Kitchens, furniture, staircases, windows and doors, designed around your rooms and made by hand from solid timber in Joel Dyter's Hebden Bridge workshop. Each piece is built to suit the house it lives in, and to be enjoyed for many years to come.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start your project</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/projects/">See recent work</a>
      </div>
      <a class="hero__wa" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappHref(site.whatsappMessage) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ icon("whatsapp", 18) }} Quick question? WhatsApp Joel</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      {% image "/images/projects/charcoal-shaker-kitchen/03.jpg", "Charcoal Shaker kitchen with an oak-topped island, handmade by Joel Dyter", "(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw", "", "eager" %}
      <p class="hero__tag">Charcoal Shaker kitchen · <a href="/projects/charcoal-shaker-kitchen/">see how it was made</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="trust">
      <li><strong>{{ site.yearsTrade }}+ years</strong> as a joiner and cabinet maker</li>
      <li><strong>Own workshop</strong> since {{ site.established }}</li>
      <li><strong>Designed, made</strong> and fitted by Joel</li>
      <li><strong>Solid timber</strong> with hand-cut joints</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Bespoke work</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Kitchens, furniture and joinery for every room</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="tiles">
      {%- set tileImages = {
        "kitchens": ["/images/projects/holland-kitchen-heptonstall/01.jpg", "Painted cottage kitchen in Heptonstall"],
        "bathrooms": ["/images/projects/washroom/01.jpg", "Painted washroom cabinetry"],
        "cabinetry": ["/images/projects/under-stairs-storage/01.jpg", "Painted under-stairs cupboards"],
        "furniture": ["/images/projects/farmhouse-dining-table/01.jpg", "Farmhouse dining table"],
        "staircases": ["/images/projects/staircases/05.jpg", "Winding oak staircase"],
        "windows-and-doors": ["/images/projects/oak-front-door/01.jpg", "Oak door in a stone arch"]
      } %}
      {%- asyncEach s in services %}
      <li class="tile">
        <a href="/{{ s.slug }}/">
          <div class="tile__media">{% image tileImages[s.slug][0], tileImages[s.slug][1], "(min-width: 1100px) 30vw, (min-width: 640px) 45vw, 92vw" %}</div>
          <h3 class="tile__title">{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split__media">{% image "/images/site/dovetail-drawer.jpg", "Hand-cut dovetails on a solid timber drawer", "(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw" %}</div>
    <div class="split__text prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Craftsmanship &amp; materials</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built by hand, fitted with care</h2>
      <p>Good joinery should feel as though it has always belonged in the house. Solid timber, hand-cut joints and careful fitting give you furniture that is a pleasure to use every day, and that wears in rather than wears out.</p>
      <p>Joel has worked as a joiner and cabinet maker for more than {{ site.yearsTrade }} years, and has run his own workshop in the Calder Valley since {{ site.established }}. He measures, designs, makes and fits each piece himself, so the person who listens to your ideas at the start is the same person who fits the last cupboard to your wall.</p>
      <p>Many homes here have uneven stone walls and old flagged floors. Each piece is shaped to sit naturally within them, which is where made-to-measure work really earns its place.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">About Joel and how he works {{ icon("arrow", 16) }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Recent work</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Recent projects</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">All projects</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      {%- asyncEach p in collections.projects | featured | limit(6) %}{% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}{% endeach %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">How a project comes together</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>First conversation</h3><p>Get in touch by phone, WhatsApp or the enquiry form. A few photos of the room and a rough budget help Joel give you a useful answer.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Visit &amp; measure</h3><p>Joel visits to see the space, take measurements and talk through how you use the room day to day.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Drawings &amp; quotation</h3><p>You receive hand drawings of the design and a full, itemised price, so you can see what you are getting before you commit.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Making</h3><p>Everything is made in the Hebden Bridge workshop, with progress photos along the way if you would like them.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fitting</h3><p>Joel fits each piece himself, scribing it to your walls and floors so it sits neatly in the room.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/testimonials-scroll.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
